#* @prisma/streams-local (via @prisma/dev <- the prisma CLI) declares engines.node ">=22.0.0"
#* AT EVERY PUBLISHED VERSION, AND YARN 1 ABORTS THE WHOLE INSTALL ON ANY ENGINE MISMATCH.
#* IT IS DEV-ONLY TOOLING FOR `prisma dev` (THE LOCAL PRISMA POSTGRES SERVER), WHICH THIS
#* PROJECT DOES NOT USE — IT TALKS TO REAL POSTGRES VIA THE `pg` ADAPTER, SO THE MODULE IS
#* NEVER LOADED AT RUNTIME. SCOPED TO `install` ON PURPOSE: `yarn run` STILL VALIDATES THE
#* ROOT engines FIELD, SO THE NODE 20.19 PIN IS STILL ENFORCED FOR EVERY SCRIPT.
--install.ignore-engines true
